","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/997","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-02-15&msg=000001bf78af%246d0d47a0%244d2f45a1%40jmagdych.na.nai.com","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-02-15&msg=200002181449.JAA03436%40dragonfly.corp.home.net","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3707ef32edab409db4eb6f5766397ecef95f7e15/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0158.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0158","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0158.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0158.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-37h5-v582-hp97/GHSA-37h5-v582-hp97.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/997/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0158.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ec509196-fbc1-4eec-ba5a-a881a3326576.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0142.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0140","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0140.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0156","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 安全域绕过漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 4.x 及 5.x 版本存在跨域文件访问漏洞（Image Source Redirect）。当 Web 服务器将浏览器窗口从一个域导航到另一个域时，IE 安全模型会检查服务器对新页面的权限。但攻击者可以构造恶意网页，将浏览器窗口打开到客户端本地文件，再将该窗口导航回攻击者所属域，使得本地文件内容在极短时间内对新窗口可访问。攻击者只需知道或猜测文件名及路径，即可读取目标计算机上可在浏览器窗口中打开的任意类型文件，但无法添加、修改或删除文件。该漏洞影响 Internet Explorer 4.0、4.01、5.0 及 5.01 版本，Microsoft 已于 2000 年 2 月发布安全公告 MS00-009 提供修复补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0156"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:07Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-009 对应补丁，可通过 Windows Update 获取更新。IE 4.01 SP1 及更早版本需升级至 IE 5.01 以上版本后再安装补丁。鉴于 Internet Explorer 已停止技术支持，建议彻底迁移至 Microsoft Edge 或 Chrome 等现代浏览器以根除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/7827","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-009","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3996","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19719","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3707ef32edab409db4eb6f5766397ecef95f7e15/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0156.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0156","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0156.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0156.json","https://github.com/biggerwing/nsfocus-rsas-knowledge-base/blob/156208b301d4649ead13cd15f827830d08245b89/example","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6rhq-4pc8-424f/GHSA-6rhq-4pc8-424f.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0156.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001173.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5c0fb57d-4fb8-422c-91cf-624cc237111c.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0140.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0140.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0140.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0138","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0138.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0154","title":"SCO UnixWare ARCserver 本地符号链接漏洞","description":"SCO UnixWare 7.1/7.1.1 中 ARCserver 组件在处理 /tmp 临时文件时未进行符号链接安全检查，本地攻击者可通过在 /tmp 目录创建恶意符号链接，诱使 ARCserver 进程以高权限向攻击者指定的任意文件写入数据，从而实现对敏感文件的非授权修改。该漏洞要求攻击者拥有本地访问权限，利用难度较低，影响 ARCserver 所管理的所有备份与恢复任务。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0154"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:06Z","remediation":"立即升级至 SCO Unixware 7.1.1 及 ARCserve 5.0 或更高版本，使用最新的安全补丁。配置 ARCserve 强制指定安全目录而不使用 /tmp，并启用对临时文件的完整性验证。降低用户权限，避免使用 root 用户操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.sco.com/security/","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/988","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-02-15&msg=000101bf78af%2494528870%244d2f45a1%40jmagdych.na.nai.com","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3707ef32edab409db4eb6f5766397ecef95f7e15/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0154.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0154","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0154.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0154.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6mjj-5236-h5mx/GHSA-6mjj-5236-h5mx.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0154.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001172.txt","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0138.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0078","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0078.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0094","title":"FreeBSD/NetBSD/OpenBSD /proc 文件系统本地权限提升漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 3.4、NetBSD 1.4.1 及 OpenBSD 2.6 等 BSD 系统的 /proc 文件系统存在本地权限提升漏洞。本地攻击者可通过修改 stderr 的文件描述符，利用 /proc/pid/mem 接口写入进程内存，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞需要攻击者拥有本地 shell 访问权限，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。受影响版本包括 FreeBSD 3.4、NetBSD 1.4.1 及 OpenBSD 2.6。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0094"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:59Z","remediation":"建议升级到修复版本：FreeBSD 升级至 3.5 及以上，OpenBSD 升级至 2.7 及以上，NetBSD 升级至 1.5 及以上。如无法升级，卸载 procfs 文件系统（umount /proc）或修改 /etc/fstab 禁止自动挂载 procfs；若必须使用，在挂载选项中添加 -o nosuid 限制提权路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/20760","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/940","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3995","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19726","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0094.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0094.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0094","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0094.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0094.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/64de4f2cd86a1126b3a6d15ba07e17a7857c3906/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-00xx/CVE-2000-0094.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1112c06e8b32d57dcace0dcdcf6de65ca1ded7e3/2000/CVE-2000-0094.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0094.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0094.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0094.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0078.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0078.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0078.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0686","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0686.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0222","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 ADMIN$共享未授权访问漏洞","description":"Windows 2000 在安装过程中直至系统首次重启前不会激活 Administrator 账户密码，导致远程攻击者可在无需认证的情况下通过 SMB 协议连接至 ADMIN$ 隐藏共享，获取系统完全控制权限。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000 所有版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击者只需知道目标 IP 地址即可在安装后的重启间隙利用空密码直接访问管理共享，进行恶意操作。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0222"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-15T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:15Z","remediation":"Windows 2000 安装完成后立即重启系统以激活管理员密码，重启前勿将系统接入网络。如无法立即重启，可先通过本地安全策略设置管理员密码，并禁用 ADMIN$ 默认共享（net share ADMIN$ /delete）。安装 Windows 2000 Service Pack 1 或更高版本可彻底修复此问题。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/990","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=20000215155750.M4500%40safe.hsc.fr","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0222.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0222","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0222/README.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0222.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9c3559b25784ca21f930998243369aaa64d45e45/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0222.json","https://github.com/Azure/Azure-Sentinel/blob/5d7fb6cfb828397f44669aa46e3f9a478b5dbc99/Sample%20Data/Custom/beSECURE_ScanResults_CL.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vg3x-6jxc-mj3p/GHSA-vg3x-6jxc-mj3p.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/S/smb_blank_admin_password.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/smb_login.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0686.toml"}]